Reason: PbpProgressPolicy.kt:71-82 uses positionMs / 1000 / stepSeconds.
0ms is the inclusive start of bucket 0, 60000ms is bucket 6 with step=10.
The test incorrectly counts both in bucket 6. Preserve size and verify both
buckets, total conservation and all other buckets zero.
